{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And these are the names of Jacob's sons.</b> What is fitting in all these is that each one of them be reckoned and known by an individual name — they are Jacob and his sons alone, as it says: וְנָשָׂא אַהֲרֹן אֶת שְׁמוֹתָם לִפְנֵי ה' (Exodus 28:12). But the rest of the seventy souls, though they were righteous, did not attain the rank of these."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 46, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:51.273724349Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}